Package: lafa
Version: 0.2.0
Section: education
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: 0
Maintainer: Edukasaun OS <dev@edukasaun.org>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-pyqt5, libqt5svg5, xdg-utils, libglib2.0-bin, fonts-noto-color-emoji, hicolor-icon-theme
Recommends: edukasaun-desktop-menu (>= 0.9.24), espeak-ng, poppler-utils, papirus-icon-theme, x11-utils, network-manager-gnome, pavucontrol-qt, pcmanfm-qt, system-config-printer, screengrab, libreoffice
Suggests: kiwix, orca, onboard, gnome-session-canberra
Homepage: https://github.com/hugomonizdorego/Eduka-Lafa
Description: Lafa - learning companion and Edukasaun OS assistant
 Lafa helps with lessons, knowledge, languages, Timor-Leste, school
 activities and using Edukasaun OS. Its main functions work without login,
 without an AI key, without a Lafa server and without internet: a local
 search of lessons (ages 5-100), the Timor-Leste atlas, Edukasaun OS guides,
 saved material and file names; practice with explanations; tasks,
 timetable, reminders and focus; read aloud with espeak-ng. Internet only
 adds sources (Wikipedia, news, weather, learning websites). The optional
 Lafa Virtual Assistant (switched on in Eduka-Settings -> Lafa-Configuration)
 is a calm crocodile from Timor-Leste on the Eduka-Panel.
